  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>奇幻中世紀城市</em></span></strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">一張從零開始打造的地圖，擁有豐富多樣的巨型建築。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">你將發現所需的一切，探索像是中世紀城堡、時代房屋、魔法塔樓以及飛行船等景點。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">大量的建築結構等待發掘，以激發創意並連接建築物。</span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>地圖開發進度：</strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">地圖仍在開發中，尚有許多絕妙點子等待實現。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">預計在不久的將來會有更多更新。</span></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>地圖：</strong></em></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">以下你可以看到地圖上的一些建築物。尺寸：10,000 x 10,000。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6a2b1697-5b86-4eb4-b42b-48181b15521d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5c9efe44-3405-4163-9299-f9fe936d74c8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_81adefde-9a6d-4e88-86c3-92ce5eee9375.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5544b322-8615-4bd2-9a1e-8a1eebceeddc.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_973c92ad-b08e-4468-8a2f-f40b1532cc27.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b110f289-1e95-439e-bc6a-0089fff0d0cf.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d4b80fa4-5103-4a70-ae72-102c0fdc34e6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dbe08de1-bcbf-41c5-9b40-512d2b5a156c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b78172b8-e5da-4556-82cb-95f768b72e5f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_899c600e-e540-4afb-b65f-8474c17ce2ef.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_65499c46-90dc-430b-8344-a6a14b840142.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4ebe7f71-e09f-4b87-8ec8-01e37d07a3cc.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7958d6c6-f2df-4805-a877-1184a67a74bb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
